  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1HpUCC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1770\" height=\"870\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><strong>《近距交战》由《Vic's Modern Warfare》的原班人马打造，是一款注重社区贡献的枪械模组，旨在创造更贴合《我的世界》美学风格的枪械内容。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong><em>支持 Minecraft 1.20.1、1.21.1 及 1.21.11 版本！</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-size:24px\"><strong>探索这些扩展包！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">毁灭战士扩展包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-doom-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XfaZVxe.png\" alt=\"描述文字\" width=\"242\" height=\"242\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">半衰期扩展包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-half-life-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_c9d74444-db0e-4ade-8d54-4da32a28f134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">刀剑神域扩展包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-gun-gale-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_54242b54-6f70-4904-bfda-0ca4293dd260.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">近距交战扩展版包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-point-blank-extended-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_e637b9dd-e498-4151-a639-d2f2d08b73e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">命运扩展包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-destiny-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q3iL0A3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（官方）蔚蓝档案扩展包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-blue-archive-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHrUfDi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"212\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">赛博朋克2077扩展包（社区制作）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/cyberpunk-2077-guns-for-vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/996/840/64/64/638513964039333793.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">光环：冬日之约扩展包（社区制作）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vpb-halo-winter-contingency\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1433/208/64/64/638928593681850821.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"138\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在游戏内管理这些扩展包，或通过菜单顶部的按钮浏览器发现更多内容：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5yl3RSY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"302\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>《近距交战》以契合《我的世界》美学的方式添加枪械，同时保持高质量的模型与动画水准。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本模组的核心特色是让零编程基础的用户也能快速为游戏添加高质量自定义枪械。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>如果您已准备好建模、贴图并完成动画的枪械资产，最快仅需10分钟即可将其导入游戏。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>易学易用，轻松实现。</strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I5TEgBi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"188\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fjbZSU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"323\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cI6rcHk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K3wezC6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>《近距交战》默认包含约40种（持续增加）武器，多数枪械支持通过按“B”键切换射击模式。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所有枪械均配备高质量换弹、检视与拔枪动画。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>枪械存在精度波动：奔跑时会降低准度，瞄准时则提升稳定性。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>生存模式：所有武器均可通过武器打印机在生存模式中合成！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m9udtQ7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J79QxYG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>自定义系统：武器可通过配件进行改装！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UW3Tvel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"752\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZSKeLsT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>创作《近距交战》内容需要两个关键工具：Geckolib 与 Blockbench。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Blockbench 是一款支持建模、贴图与动画制作的第三方软件。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您还需在 Blockbench 中安装 Geckolib 插件。更多信息请参阅 Geckolib 描述文档中的维基指南。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>入门请参考我们的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-template-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方模板内容包</a></span>，可用于创建自定义内容。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong>视频教程：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ASlc1_bvItE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lDwSw3pE_1k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEa0fKyU2QI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
